[[2047,127,64,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The circuit for the dipped beam headlamps\nis operated by the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>By placing the switch in the dipped beam\nposition, the line which supplies the headlamps \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (left)\nand \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (right) is supplied controlled by the ignition.</p><p>The signal is sent to the headlamp internal\nelectronic circuit,w hich manages activation of the bulb.</p><p>Each circuit is protected by a fuse for\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for the left headlamp and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for\nthe right one.</p><p>The supply passes throught the headlamps\nmaintenance relay/remote control switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J45</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which only interrupts\nthis supply during starting (AVV signal from the starter motor).</p><p>The supply line for the left lamp also acts\nas an enablement signal for the rear fog lamps (check device inside\nthe rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233898\">E2031</a></p>"]]